@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
[*] --> Assigned : AI labels set and case routed
Assigned --> InProgress : officer opens case
InProgress --> AwaitingInfo : more information needed
AwaitingInfo --> InProgress : information received
Assigned --> Escalated : due date passed
InProgress --> Escalated : due date passed
AwaitingInfo --> Escalated : due date passed
Escalated --> InProgress : supervisor intervenes
InProgress --> Resolved : resolution recorded
Resolved --> Closed : complainant notified
Closed --> [*]
state InProgress : In Progress
state AwaitingInfo : Awaiting Info
@enduml
